  "problemStatement": "Find the arc length of the curve r(t) = <t, (2/3) t^(3/2), t> from t = 0 to t = 3.",
  "finalAnswer": "\\frac{2}{3}(5\\sqrt{5} - 2\\sqrt{2})",
  "steps": [
